se of accommodation” and align financial conditions with its objectives • Inflation remains “too high,” with summer data showing little meaningful improvement • With the labor market stable, price stability is now the Fed’s predominant focus • Warsh declined to signal another hike, saying he is “not in the forward-guidance business” • He said policy will respond to broader trends, calling dependence on individual data releases “dangerous” • Stronger growth, persistent inflation and geopolitical risks drove the unanimous decision • Warsh rejected claims that markets led the hike, stressing it was the Fed’s independent decision • He said the Fed does not need to weaken the labor market to bring inflation down News | Markets | YouTube","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/P_LNJ58m2U-RuEqeWW7mPjAjdPozmdwkO_IDDFysN_wC_wuUFgdl6_uzX63J2f1H8jhGMVCiOAXhJS3Aa7oa4pMadVHZY7WOgnldknHLufQzu5rsx6sg9cYC0_wanN2q1P0YpLFh8G-B7IjTd69688rwarVDlJU5iKcRtOHggp9Gd8epUDJcIiGHnuVnTj7eCT1E_UQxv_NSL9W8ShSObhONe6nmvnRvFmHa0PKfS9G7lMdwm7kCaIGvNFgPD4cZSGpnhTUONMMbC8zeL0cLwvEqbUk8bMx_DUB7L71divlVgY7b02sNmv7wGl7cqgTe2LMjjJwaK_MAFQdxQHml5Q.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"72158","date":"2026-09-16T19:05:01+00:00","text":"🇺🇸 WARSH: “ The economy has indeed strengthened. Underlying growth is higher. Inflation is the problem.” News | Markets | YouTube","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/KCdUwZ5wGUVqzV46GFdbP4OgjXr-g_Yyr39ww1iTOjG8rKiOPjM-Z5--BQgDtUwYYH9IZknlFU-7fMeNfVUKkk8CE6WX_cW_1r_gWclokZVPLzGCFmKkN3VCLvC47tKp0uqEVw3q8XVhJPvE7P1BAemD3gehzkCNKZ8mqnsJdyvtusKMYHNduC0Cb_EODwdNJU-Ujf10zDOJGLgU57lcQtAdQMtLE-O3MQKf3PH_nxQiVoQrI4Xj8YaNJ03SeFiaV6DAGCCe6UfB66HDYVZKGtr9iBPlpyMn6CcA3k7rBNiJ5iy7H9zvCbR1dh6toxM3PSg_oMr52oJTZXFaDaCWHg","video":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/82bf1c5ed3.mp4?token=Dd5c8vmjQkxF7LJGGKmrt-jV5uRy-l2LDuCR06g2cq7nc9bFHv6G3IwVM814v_UfHJPLniEgpktpSYT81SYcNNcwJxgKPhMZ8Kkt08sz05DdwhwAaBNEsJqIec4XtesE_k9QJDTCM2V3eyf5FM4IIdQPa6UsTGiVp-XmlGRwHHL2dC9G-mtifozW1212kd97hW7UpgYyX-5iWX1MqlhVx